  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Overland Trip to India to help Calcutta Rescue</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Hans Verdonschot,60, a psychiatric nurse and environmentalist is setting off from Holland on an epic 11,000km journey to India on public transport to raise money for Calcutta Rescue (CR). He&apos;ll arrive in Kolkata three weeks later having travelled across 10 countries. Hans hopes his trip will raise Euros 11,000 ($12000 approx) for CR&apos;s work but also wants to inspire others, including the 650 youngsters from the slums that CR is helping to educate. Please help Hans to make his goal a reality.</narrative>
  </description>
